  "description": "Trapped in a game where she’s a spy tasked with seducing the men of the Empire, our protagonist finds herself in a twisted reverse harem scenario with no way out.\n\n*“Did I log in to the game last night? But I don't remember logging in...”*\n\nWhat started as an immersive gaming experience for her day off quickly turns into a nightmare when she realizes she’s stuck inside. Now, surrounded by irresistibly handsome men and intense encounters, she desperately wants to escape. But there’s one problem: the game doesn’t plan on letting her leave anytime soon!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
